        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The Board of Education recognizes that the officers of MCCSSE, elected representatives, and stewards, not to exceed two (2) per school and not to exceed four (4) each in the Educational Services and Lincoln Centers, are authorized to act for MCCSSE. Council matters will be conducted at times least disruptive to school system business.",
